{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0314","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000137:text","row":40113,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"「どもー」","en":"“Hey there.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904816","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00001","en":"Taichi: \"Hellooo.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000001df:text","row":40114,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"「ああ、おはようございます」","en":"“Oh. Good morning.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904817","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00002","en":"Misato: \"Aaah, good morning, yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:0000021b:text","row":40115,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうですか？」","en":"“How’s it going?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904818","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00003","en":"Taichi: \"How is it going?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000002c9:text","row":40116,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"「全然順調じゃありません」","en":"“Not well at all.”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904819","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00004","en":"Misato: \"Not favorably at all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000303:text","row":40117,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"「大変ですね」","en":"“That's rough.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904820","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00005","en":"Taichi: \"What a problem.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000329:text","row":40118,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナを見る。","en":"I looked at the antenna.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904821","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00006","en":"I look at the antenna.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000351:text","row":40119,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"根本に鉄骨やら針金やら工具やら……おいおい、工具まで高所に置きっぱなしだよ。","en":"Steel beams, wire, tools scattered around its base... Seriously, she'd even left tools sitting around this high up.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904822","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00007","en":"At the base, steel framing, wiring, tools, the like... oh, come on, she just keeps leaving those tools high up there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000003bd:text","row":40120,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"「ふーん、これが噂のアンテナかぁ」","en":"“So this is the antenna I’ve heard so much about.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904823","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00008","en":"Taichi: \"Hmm-hm, this is the antenna the rumors talk about theeen,\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000003f7:text","row":40121,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"などと脚立の上の危険物を床におろす。","en":"With that, I lowered the hazardous clutter from the top of the stepladder to the floor.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904824","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00009","en":"and with that I go to lay down on the floor the hazardous materials from the top of the stepladder.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000004b9:text","row":40122,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"「……あのう？」","en":"“...Um?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904825","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00010","en":"Misato: \"...uhmmm?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000004e9:text","row":40123,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ、こうなってるのかー」","en":"“Oh, so that’s how this works.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904826","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00011","en":"Taichi: \"Ahhh, so that's how it happens then!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","tense_aspect"],"assessment":"Taichi pretends to inspect how the antenna is physically put together. The English instead refers to how an unspecified event happens.","remedy":"so this is how it's put together","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":15,"text":"so that's how it happens then"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:0000051b:text","row":40124,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"アンテナの途中にひっかけられた工具類も全部床に。","en":"Then I took down every tool caught on the antenna and set them on the floor too.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904827","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00012","en":"I also put all the tools hung partway up the antenna on the floor.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000588:text","row":40125,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"「寝ぼけてます？」","en":"“Are you sleepwalking?”","speakerJa":"見里","speakerEn":"Misato","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904828","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00013","en":"Misato: \"Are you still asleep?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000005ba:text","row":40126,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"「いえ、超冷静ですー」","en":"“Nope. I'm perfectly clearheaded.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904829","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00014","en":"Taichi: \"No, hyper awake I aaam!\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Taichi says he is extremely calm or clearheaded, denying that he is befuddled. Being awake only denies sleep and does not convey composure.","remedy":"perfectly clearheaded","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":13,"text":"hyper awake"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000005f0:text","row":40127,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"「ではでは、またまた」","en":"“Well, see you around.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904830","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00015","en":"Taichi: \"Then well then, seeya-seeya!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:0000061e:text","row":40128,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"先輩はぽかーんと俺を見送っていた。","en":"Misato stared blankly as I left.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904831","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00016","en":"Senpai watched me leave, mouth agape.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000658:text","row":40129,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"このタイミングを外せば、怪我はない……はず。","en":"If I threw off the timing now, she wouldn't get hurt... probably.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904832","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00017","en":"Pulling them down at this juncture she won't be injured... probably.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000781:text","row":40130,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「あ」","en":"“Oh.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904833","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00018","en":"Taichi: \"Ah.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:0000079f:text","row":40131,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"……怪我させないと進展しないんだっけか？","en":"...Wait. Hadn’t I only made progress because she got hurt?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904834","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00019","en":"...but if I don't let her get injured, then there won't be any progress, will it?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:000007e7:text","row":40132,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"「でもなあ」","en":"“Still...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904835","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00020","en":"Taichi: \"Yeah, but...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:0000080b:text","row":40133,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"だからといって、事故を見逃すってのは……。","en":"But I couldn't exactly sit back and let an accident happen...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904836","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00021","en":"But letting the incident just happen because of that...","verdict":"questionable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000855:text","row":40134,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「はあ」","en":"“Haaah.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904837","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00022","en":"Taichi: \"Sigh.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0314:00000875:text","row":40135,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"結局、攻略をはやめる効果はないんだろうな。","en":"Guess this wouldn’t help me win her over any faster after all.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904838","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0020a:00023","en":"In the end, there will likely be no acceleration in the capture from this.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]}]}
